          "message": {
            "text": "The External API's identity is verified only via TLS; DNS hijacking or a BGP route hijack could redirect ToolServer's outbound calls to an attacker-controlled endpoint.",
            "markdown": "Pin the leaf certificate on outbound HTTPS calls; validate CN/SAN against the expected provider identity; enable HSTS preload."
