          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/agentic-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "The Orchestrator's `Response (HTTPS)` to the User carries no disclosed AI-authorship marker and no boundary on authority-claim framing; a manipulated or unconstrained response can present fabricated confidence or authority (e.g., relaying ClinAdvisor's clinical framing verbatim) that a human user reasonably treats as an authoritative, human-reviewed answer, exploiting the user's trust in the interaction.",
            "markdown": "Disclose AI authorship on every user-facing response; strip or flag authority-claim language not backed by a verified source; rate-limit persona/authority framing changes within a session; log user-facing authority claims to the Audit Logger for review."
          },
          "level": "error",
