          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "Adversarial content in the Clinical Query / Context payload (via the original prompt, adversarial KB documents, or a compromised Orchestrator) can override ClinAdvisor's system prompt or fabricate recommendations.",
            "markdown": "Enforce instruction-boundary protection on ClinAdvisor's system prompt; sanitize clinical-query content; validate output for system-prompt leakage."
