            "affected_assets": []
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "tachi/ai/llm-threats",
          "message": {
            "text": "The Orchestrator can instruct the Tool Server to fetch a URL synthesized from LLM output; an attacker who influences that output can direct the fetch at internal metadata endpoints or RFC 1918 ranges, executing SSRF under the Tool Server's **server-side** network credentials.",
            "markdown": "Allowlist outbound hostnames at the Tool Server; block egress to RFC 1918/link-local/metadata ranges; restrict scheme to `{http, https}`; apply DNS pinning."
          },
          "level": "error",
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
